<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <script src="/js/shimmer.js"></script>
  <style>
    .policy-container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .policy-hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .policy-hero h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .policy-hero p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .policy-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }

    .policy-card h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #1e293b;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .policy-card p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #475569;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .policy-card ul {
      margin-left: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .policy-card li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .highlight-box {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border-left: 4px solid #e91e63;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .highlight-box p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="user-layout">
  <%- include('../partials/user-header') %>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="policy-container">
      <div class="policy-hero">
        <h1>Shipping & Delivery Policy</h1>
        <p>Reliable and fast delivery for all your premium sneaker purchases</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>Order Processing Time</h2>
        <p>All orders placed on KAVOX are processed within 1-2 business days. Orders are not shipped or delivered on weekends or public holidays.</p>
        <p>If we are experiencing a high volume of orders, shipments may be delayed by a few days. Please allow additional days in transit for delivery.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>Shipping Methods & Delivery Timelines</h2>
        <p>We partner with leading courier services (DHL, FedEx, BlueDart, Delhivery) to offer the following shipping methods:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> Delivered within 5-7 business days.</li>
          <li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> Delivered within 2-3 business days.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <p>Please note: Delivery timelines are estimates and commence from the date of shipping, rather than the date of order.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>Shipping Charges & Free Shipping Policy</h2>
        <p>Shipping charges for your order will be calculated and displayed at checkout.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> Free for all orders above ₹4,999. A flat rate of ₹150 applies to orders below this threshold.</li>
          <li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> A premium rate of ₹350 applies to all express delivery options.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>Tracking Information</h2>
        <p>Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive a shipping confirmation email containing your tracking number(s). The tracking number will be active within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>Customs, Duties & Taxes</h2>
        <p>KAVOX is not responsible for any customs and taxes applied to your order. All fees imposed during or after shipping are the responsibility of the customer (tariffs, taxes, etc.).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>Damages & Lost Packages</h2>
        <p>KAVOX is not liable for any products damaged or lost during shipping. If you received your order damaged, please contact the shipment carrier or our support team directly to file a claim. Please save all packaging material and damaged goods before filing a claim.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>Contact Information</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding our Shipping Policy, feel free to get in touch with our customer service team:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> support@kavox.com</li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +91 98765 43210 (Mon-Sat, 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM IST)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/user-footer') %>
</body>

</html>
